{"sections":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Since you have learned how OUDS works with theme, themeable view, components, tuning and view modifiers, it is time now to discover some online resources."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"hero","estimatedTimeInMinutes":10,"backgroundImage":"ic_theme_intro.png","title":"Going further with more resources","image":"ic_theme_intro.png","chapter":"Go further with more ressources"},{"kind":"tasks","tasks":[{"title":"More resources","contentSection":[{"kind":"contentAndMedia","mediaPosition":"trailing","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Xcode can use the Swift DocC documentation of OUDS, and this documentation is used to build a static web site."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"But there are also other resources which can be useful for you."}]}]}],"stepsSection":[{"type":"step","caption":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"You can get it at "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/ios.unified-design-system.orange.com\/"}]}],"runtimePreview":null,"code":null,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The iOS technical documentation is available online. It has been generated from all the Swift DocC documentation written in the Swift Package."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"You will find several catalogs (as many as librairies) with details about everyhting: components, tokens, themes, providers, etc."}]}],"media":"tutorial-discovery-6-1.png"},{"type":"step","caption":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Go to the website and learn things at "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/unified-design-system.orange.com\/"}]}],"runtimePreview":null,"code":null,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The whole design system is documented and available online. You can find everything a